<title>USA: GOLF-TIGER WOODS WINS WESTERN OPEN BY THREE STROKES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-TIGER WOODS WINS WESTERN OPEN BY THREE STROKES.</headline>
<dateline>LEMONT, Illinois 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tiger Woods won his fourth tournament of the season by shooting a four-under-par 68 Sunday to claim a three-stroke victory over New Zealand's Frank Nobilo at the Western Open.</p>
</text>
